 C 12.011 C.pz-vbc.UPF
CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
 -1.613990  0.000000  1.613990
  0.000000  1.613990  1.613990
 -1.613990  1.613990  0.000000
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
 C  -0.125 -0.125 -0.125
 C   0.125  0.125  0.125
K_POINTS automatic
 6 6 6 0 0 0
